Date: Thu, 3 Sep 2026 19:05:05 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] =?UTF-8?q?ether:=20minimal=20Robin=20home=20=E2=80=94?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20hotseat=20only,=20no=202nd=20page,=20no=20clock=20(Trebuchet?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20source)?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The device-overlay minimal-home (0029) never reached the launcher: the build
sets PRODUCT_ENFORCE_RRO_TARGETS := * so the static device overlay of Trebuchet
is not merged, and the stock default_workspace (with its Google folder / 2nd
page) shipped. Patch the Trebuchet SOURCE default_workspace directly instead, so
the clean single-page hotseat-only layout is baked into the APK. Robin uses the
4x5 grid; all common grids covered. No clock widget (there is a status-bar clock).
---
 res/xml/default_workspace_4x5.xml | 123 ++--------------------------
 res/xml/default_workspace_5x5.xml | 131 ++----------------------------
 res/xml/default_workspace_5x6.xml | 131 ++----------------------------
 res/xml/default_workspace_5x7.xml | 131 ++----------------------------
 res/xml/default_workspace_6x6.xml | 131 ++----------------------------
 5 files changed, 41 insertions(+), 606 deletions(-)

